<title>SINGAPORE: Chiyoda awarded contract for Chevron plant.</title>
<headline>Chiyoda awarded contract for Chevron plant.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chevron Chemical has awarded Chiyoda Corp with a lump-sum turnkey contract to design and build a U.S.$200 million-plus Singapore plant, Chevron said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The plant would be operational in late 1998 and be located on an island off southern Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
